{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，果然美羽学姐好厉害啊……」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4765", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真没想到，她已经察觉到我们的事情了」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得，就我像个傻瓜一样在钻牛角尖……」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4766", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管纱凪叹了口气，但表情却很平和。", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一直以来都瞒着美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而美羽学姐拯救了纱凪的心。", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的祝福将纱凪从自我束缚中解救了出来。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": "学姐的祝福将纱凪从自我束缚中解救了出来。", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我，能不能成为像学姐一样的人啊……」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4767", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这可说不准」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎——意思是我成为不了吗？」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4768", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是那个意思」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为纱凪就是纱凪，美羽学姐就是美羽学姐」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这我也明白……但还是觉得很憧憬。\\n　心里就有想要成为那种人的想法……」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "「这我也明白……但还是觉得很憧憬。　心里就有想要成为那种人的想法……」", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4769", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，要是你被像美羽学姐一样的人表白了，你会高兴吗？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": "「新吾，要是你被像美羽学姐一样的人表白了，你会高兴吗？」", "plain_idx": 188, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4770", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么这么问？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为、为什么，这可是那个美羽学姐哦？\\n　要我是男人，肯定会变成她的跟屁虫的」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "「为、为什么，这可是那个美羽学姐哦？　要我是男人，肯定会变成她的跟屁虫的」", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4771", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你真的很喜欢美羽学姐啊」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以说，真的没兴趣吗？」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4772", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有的」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「即使对方是那个轻飘飘的、治愈的、胸还很大的，\\n　最强的学姐？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "「即使对方是那个轻飘飘的、治愈的、胸还很大的，　最强的学姐？」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4773", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但对我来说，最强的是纱凪啊」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你真的对我这么着迷吗？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4774", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那当然，我可是被你迷得不能自已了……\\n　甚至连现在，我都一直在忍耐着」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "「那当然，我可是被你迷得不能自已了……　甚至连现在，我都一直在忍耐着」", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一不小心说出了真心话。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，就不要忍了，亲我就好了嘛」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6928", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一不小心说出口的“忍耐”，\\n纱凪似乎当作是忍耐接吻了。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "我一不小心说出口的“忍耐”，纱凪似乎当作是忍耐接吻了。", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且，我现在是新吾的人，\\n　不如说和我客气反而有点奇怪吧……」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": "「而且，我现在是新吾的人，　不如说和我客气反而有点奇怪吧……」", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4776", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……被新吾强行亲嘴，其实感觉挺心动的」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4777", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那个，倒也不是希望你强势点，\\n　只是觉得偶尔这么来一次也挺好的……」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「啊，那个，倒也不是希望你强势点，　只是觉得偶尔这么来一次也挺好的……」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4778", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的脸变得通红，慌慌张张地说道。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……即便知道纱凪指的只是接吻，\\n但这句话的破坏力也几乎要到把我的理智给吹飞的地步了。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": "……即便知道纱凪指的只是接吻，但这句话的破坏力也几乎要到把我的理智给吹飞的地步了。", "plain_idx": 221, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正因如此……", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉。但是今天我想对你温柔点」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4779", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我让纱凪坐在秋千上，并在她的脸上轻吻了一下。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是要维持住自己的理性一般，温柔而又轻轻地。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪脸上的微热以及一闪而过的紧张感，\\n这份令人怜爱的反应，让我重新恢复了正常。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "纱凪脸上的微热以及一闪而过的紧张感，这份令人怜爱的反应，让我重新恢复了正常。", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就亲脸颊不够」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4780", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「知道啦」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4781", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回应纱凪可爱的请求，我吻上了她的嘴唇。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能是用力过度，\\n秋千上的锁链都发出了响声。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "可能是用力过度，秋千上的锁链都发出了响声。", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……笨蛋，太温柔了」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4782", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说，今天就是那种心情」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我现在腰有点软了暂时起不来」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4783", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我用公主抱把你抱回家怎样？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜——真是让人难以舍弃的方案啊……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4784", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你有其它替代方案吗」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4785", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，在我能站起来之前，就在这里聊聊天吧」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4786", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样我可以和新吾待得更久♪」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4787", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，这样的话……」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，等……喂！\\n　要是再亲我，我不就一直都站不起来了吗」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": "「哎，等……喂！　要是再亲我，我不就一直都站不起来了吗」", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4788", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，等……嗯——？！」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4789", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果我还是没能忍住，又夺走了纱凪的嘴唇。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便纱凪责备我，我也停不下来。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……新吾你，\\n　其实是个比我还严重的接吻狂魔吧……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": "「哈……新吾你，　其实是个比我还严重的接吻狂魔吧……」", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6929", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得倒不至于」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，就是单纯喜欢不分场合地，\\n　强硬地夺走我的嘴唇吗……？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "「那，就是单纯喜欢不分场合地，　强硬地夺走我的嘴唇吗……？」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6930", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不是因为纱凪喜欢吗？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「偶、偶尔，只是偶尔！」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6931", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然，也不是讨厌啦……是挺喜欢的……\\n　而且刚刚我的心也一直跳个不停……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "「虽然，也不是讨厌啦……是挺喜欢的……　而且刚刚我的心也一直跳个不停……」", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6932", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪你还真是个接吻狂魔啊」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊啊，总觉得我又说了些多余的话，\\n　自掘坟墓了……」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "「啊啊啊啊，总觉得我又说了些多余的话，　自掘坟墓了……」", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6933", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当纱凪能够站起来走路的时候，\\n周围已经完全暗下来了。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "当纱凪能够站起来走路的时候，周围已经完全暗下来了。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「冷静一想，真的非常不甘心」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4791", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不甘心？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为，我明明很讨厌男性的，\\n　结果被亲一下就软了腰……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「因为，我明明很讨厌男性的，　结果被亲一下就软了腰……」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4792", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我这种情况，你怎么看？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4793", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可爱到让人犯愁的地步了」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4794", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回过神来，发现纱凪似乎在索求更多接吻似的，直直地盯着我的嘴唇。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "回过神来，发现纱凪似乎在索求更多接吻似的，直直地盯着我的嘴唇。", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好抓住哦」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4795", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱住纱凪的腰，不知道又和纱凪接吻了多少次。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一瞬间，纱凪的膝盖一软，她倚靠在我身上。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以都说了接吻……不行，笨蛋新吾……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4796", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的吗？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……唔……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6934", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我窥视着纱凪的眼眸深处问道，\\n纱凪的视线慌乱地游离着。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "我窥视着纱凪的眼眸深处问道，纱凪的视线慌乱地游离着。", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6935", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但最后，她还是用含泪的眼睛回视我。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你会好好负责的吧。\\n　把我变成了现在这副模样……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "「你会好好负责的吧。　把我变成了现在这副模样……」", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4798", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「每天都和我接吻，每天都让我站不起来，\\n　让我变成这么没用的女人……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "「每天都和我接吻，每天都让我站不起来，　让我变成这么没用的女人……」", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4799", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这是不是意味着，你希望我把你变得更没用？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6938", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我会好好负责的」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等等，所以说接吻不行……啊……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4800", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，到这里就行了」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4801", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，我还是一路以公主抱的姿势将纱凪送了回来。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一不留神就到这么晚了啊」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说回来，公主抱好厉害……」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4802", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是……嗯……\\n　不实际体验一下是不懂的…」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "「那是……嗯……　不实际体验一下是不懂的…」", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4803", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在站不起来的情况下被公主抱时的感觉真的……\\n　怎么形容呢……除了厉害说不出其它词了……」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「在站不起来的情况下被公主抱时的感觉真的……　怎么形容呢……除了厉害说不出其它词了……」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4804", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便把纱凪放了下来，\\n纱凪也一直粘着我不打算离开。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "即便把纱凪放了下来，纱凪也一直粘着我不打算离开。", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是大家看到我这样，肯定会笑话我的吧。\\n　连我自己都觉得不像是自己会做的事情……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「要是大家看到我这样，肯定会笑话我的吧。　连我自己都觉得不像是自己会做的事情……」", "plain_idx": 334, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4805", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事，不会笑话你的。\\n　毕竟大家都那样祝福我们了」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "「没事，不会笑话你的。　毕竟大家都那样祝福我们了」", "plain_idx": 337, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我不是指社团里的大家。\\n　我是指同班的人会怎么想……」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "「不，我不是指社团里的大家。　我是指同班的人会怎么想……」", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4806", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么在意周围的人怎么看你的吗？」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我之前说过“瓜生这人哪里好了？”\\n　还有“说那种人是好人简直难以置信。”之类的话，\\n　还对班上的女生大肆宣扬过……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": "「因为我之前说过“瓜生这人哪里好了？”　还有“说那种人是好人简直难以置信。”之类的话，　还对班上的女生大肆宣扬过……」", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 63, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4807", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实，那样就可能要在意周围的人的视线了。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，我觉得还是没关系的」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4808", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我和纱凪都不是过去的自己了。自从喜欢上纱凪后，\\n　我觉得我往好的方向改变了」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "「我和纱凪都不是过去的自己了。自从喜欢上纱凪后，　我觉得我往好的方向改变了」", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且我相信这之后也会继续往好的方向改变」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
